Here the prefix my_ indicates that each core is using its own, private variables, and each core can execute this block of code independently of the other cores. After each core completes execution of this code, its variable my_sum will store the sum of the values computed by its calls to Compute_next_value. For example, if there are eight cores, n = 24, and the 24 calls to Compute_next_value return the values
